<title>NEW ZEALAND: Capital Group cuts stake in Lion.</title>
<headline>Capital Group cuts stake in Lion.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Capital Group Companies Inc said in a substantial security holder notice that it had reduced its interest in Lion Nathan to 9.2 percent from 10.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
